<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  GGym launcher icon — foreground layer.
  Geometry transcribed 1:1 from artwork/ggym.svg (the brand source of truth), mapped into the
  adaptive-icon safe zone: the SVG's 1024-unit canvas is scaled by 0.078 and centred, which
  puts the artwork's bounding box (900x500 units) at 70x39dp inside the 72x72 safe zone.

  Deliberately NOT ported from the SVG:
   - the `feDropShadow` neon glow (VectorDrawable has no blur; a faked halo would smear under
     circular masks). The glow survives in artwork/ggym.svg and in preview/index.html.
   - the 2-4 unit highlight strokes on the plates and centre bar (0.16-0.31dp after scaling,
     i.e. sub-pixel).
-->
